 early mistakes, lessons from the field\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**20 Product Posts** — feature and value-focused content:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"\\\"Why our adaptive learning engine reduces course dropout by 40%\\\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"\\\"How we built our assessment module in 3 weeks\\\"\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"New feature announcements\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"27\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Integration capabilities\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Benchmark comparisons\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"29\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Both sets were written and scheduled by Gravity. Posting cadence was alternated: one story post, one product post, repeat.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"31\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Engagement Comparison\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"33\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\"$\",\"div\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Founder story posts won on every engagement metric. Not by a small margin — impressions were nearly 3x higher. Comments were 3.5x more.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"But Then We Looked at Conversions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Here's where it gets interesting.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Of the 36 total DMs Sameer received over the 6 weeks, here's the breakdown by post type that prompted the DM:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],null,null,null,null,null,[\"$\",\"div\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Product posts generated fewer DMs but a higher conversion rate per DM. Founder story posts generated more DMs but more of them were \\\"congrats,\\\" \\\"loved this,\\\" or \\\"I can relate\\\" — not business conversations.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"58\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The Real Story (It's Both)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"When Sameer looked at his 5 closed deals over the 6-week period, the pattern was revealing:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"4 out of 5 customers first engaged with a founder story post\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Then they followed his profile\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Then they saw a product post 1–2 weeks later\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Then they sent a DM\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The founder story content was the hook. The product content was the close. Neither worked as well alone as they did together.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The customers who converted from a pure product post were already searching for a solution and happened to find him at the right moment. But the customers who went through the full funnel — story first, product second — were warmer, moved faster through the sales process, and churned less.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"What This Means for Your Content Strategy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Don't choose.** Use both. But use them in the right sequence.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Founder story posts build trust and expand your audience. Product posts activate that audience and drive intent. The mistake most founders make is going all-in on one type and wondering why either nothing converts (all story) or nobody follows (all product).\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Gravity's content calendar is built on this principle — it alternates content types deliberately, not randomly, to guide a cold audience through the trust-to-intent journey.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"78\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"79\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Conclusion\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"80\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"81\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"6 weeks, 40 posts, 36 DMs, 5 conversions. The experiment didn't crown one content type as the winner. It showed that both types serve different parts of the funnel — and that the founders winning on LinkedIn are the ones using both strategically.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"82\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"83\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"84\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Key Takeaways\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"85\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"86\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Founder story posts get 3x the engagement but lower direct conversion rate per DM\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"87\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Product posts attract buyers who are already in-market and ready to demo\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"88\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The highest-converting funnel is: story post (awareness) → product post (intent) → DM (conversion)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"89\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Mixing content types consistently outperforms going all-in on either one\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"90\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"91\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"92\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 italic my-2\",\"children\":\"Want Gravity to build your content mix and manage the full sequence automatically? [Start your free 7-day trial →](/)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 bg-brand-gold-pale dark:bg-brand-gold/8 border border-brand-gold/20 dark:border-brand-gold/15 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2\",\"children\":\"Ready to automate your GTM?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 mb-4\",\"children\":\"100 free credits. No card required. Setup in 24 hours.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/pricing\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold rounded-full px-6 py-3 hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all hover:scale-[1.03]\",\"children\":\"Start your free trial →\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"c